                    coach_r1_reviewers:     `<strong>That is the real constraint.</strong> 1,900 humans cannot manually review 41,000 edits — attention, not edit volume, is the scarce resource. Name reviewer capacity as the bottleneck and every later move (tooling, recognition, reinforcements) points at the right thing.`,
                    coach_r1_volume:        `<strong>“Stop the edits” treats the symptom, not the constraint.</strong> The 41,000 edits are the attack's output; the bottleneck is that 1,900 reviewers cannot triage them. Stopping all edits also stops the 4,000 good-faith improvements your volunteers make each week.`,
