                    coach_r3_autorevert:    `<strong>It caught most of the attack — and reverted 140 trusted editors whose work tripped the model.</strong> Those editors are furious, the false-positive rate is the new scandal, and you have taught the community the machine does not trust them. A classifier should flag for humans, not auto-revert.`,
