                    insight_closed:         `Blunt-instrument trap: locking the articles stopped the abuse and the contribution alike. You traded a “poisoned” reputation for a “censoring/closed” one, the forums filled with “Savoir is dead,” and you broke the community trust the commons runs on. The attackers turned the encyclopedia anyone can edit into one nobody can.`,
